      "role": "user",
      "content": "Uh, hey, I think there might be a mistake in the draft. The metaphors about \"goblins\" and \"gobbling\" are a bit much for a VP of Product at a fintech company. Can you rewrite that to be strictly professional and remove all the fantasy analogies? Just stick to the technical differences and the AWS implementation details.",
